title: "Borg (Bring yer Own GRaphics): An Open-Source Tile-Based GPU with Silicon Tapeout"
abstract: "A RISC-V SoC with a tile-based GPU featuring vertex shading, rasterization, and FP16 fragment shading, targeting ECP5 FPGAs and ASIC (IHP SG13G2 tapeout). Funded by NLnet NGI0 Commons Fund."
